{"3070880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farming & Supermarket Simulator", "steam_appid": 3070880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; is a delightful simulation game where you build a farm, grow organic products, feed your animals, and expand your business by selling your products in your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your farm is too small? Then expand it further. Open more farmland, purchase new machines, and increase animal diversity to grow your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; will show you how enjoyable managing both a farm and a supermarket can be. Set your strategy, grow step by step, and achieve success. Enjoy this detailed and delightful gaming experience and become the owner of a large farm and supermarket chain!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; is a delightful simulation game where you build a farm, grow organic products, feed your animals, and expand your business by selling your products in your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/712613ddd0613d6588c7d221a2dcafdb.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/8ba366275e2d3ed672f2876474fefe21.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/fcbec3284c7bdcbe05564a2d1795886c.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/69d284bb826c99a29b9c6b9578aae2fd.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/704cb1bf3819e2accc9583a58467139f.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.poster.avif?t=1784565294\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.webm?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/extras/70425e5b910ef9896f812efc6b341a2f.mp4?t=1784565294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your farm is too small? Then expand it further. Open more farmland, purchase new machines, and increase animal diversity to grow your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator&quot; will show you how enjoyable managing both a farm and a supermarket can be. Set your strategy, grow step by step, and achieve success. Enjoy this detailed and delightful gaming experience and become the owner of a large farm and supermarket chain!</p>", "short_description": "Embark on a relaxing yet challenging journey to manage your own supermarket. Grow organic crops, care for your animals, and sell products to your customers. Build and expand your shelves. Can you transform your supermarket into an empire?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Portugal, Polish, Dutch, Spanish - Latin America, Greek, Czech, Hindi, Vietnamese, Arabic, Thai, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/70d20c692eb240ffb53cb016583673fb53f255a1/header.jpg?t=1784565294", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/12571a5c16c35027327ea5e5ec6a9473962eaeb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784565294", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070880/12571a5c16c35027327ea5e5ec6a9473962eaeb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784565294", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><